OL,3,AAmazon rigged $20bn worth of ad prices,
OL,4,AUS lawsuit alleges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Federal Trade Commission (FTC)
OL,7,Fand a bipartisan group of 22 states has
OL,8,Ffiled a lawsuit alleging Amazon
OL,9,Fsecretly overcharged more than a
OL,10,Fmillion advertising customers by
OL,11,Fmanipulating online auctions it uses to
OL,12,Fset ad prices.
OL,14,FThe FTC and states say in their lawsuit
OL,15,Ffiled Monday that the alleged scheme
OL,16,Fhas likely netted the company $20bn
OL,17,Ffrom advertising customers since 2019.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
