OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F106A1788247482
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAmazon rigged $20bn worth of ad prices,
OL,4,AUS lawsuit alleges
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Amazon overrides and replaces the
OL,7,Factual auction results with higher
OL,8,Fprices set by Amazon to increase its
OL,9,Fprofits," says a complaint filed in the
OL,10,Fcompany's home state of Washington.
OL,12,FIn a statement to the BBC, Amazon
OL,13,F"strongly disagrees" with the premise
OL,14,Fthat it misled advertisers and called
OL,15,Fthe suit "misguided."
